Value pid (\d+)
Value tty (\d+)
Value allocated (\d+)
Value freed (\d+)
Value holding (\d+)
Value getbufs (\d+)
Value retbufs (\d+)
Value process (.+)

Start
  ^Processor\s+Pool\s+Total: -> Start
  ^reserve\s+P\s+Pool\s+Total: -> Start
  ^\s*PID\s+TTY\s+Allocated\s+Freed\s+Holding\s+Getbufs\s+Retbufs\s+Process -> Start
  ^\s*${pid}\s+${tty}\s+${allocated}\s+${freed}\s+${holding}\s+${getbufs}\s+${retbufs}\s+${process}\s*$$ -> Record
